<title>UK: Warner Est seeks Merivale JV stake.</title>
<headline>Warner Est seeks Merivale JV stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warner Estate Holdings Plc, the diversified UK property investor, on Thursday said it was in talks to acquire Merivale Moore Plc's 50 percent share of joint ventures to trade commercial properties.</p>
<p>These joint ventures had property values of about 18 million stg of which Warner's interest were valued around two million, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Merivale is a commercial property investment and trading company.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
